WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
ClinicalCode animates the clinical source code of disease progression.
Clinical observations become executable states and inspectable futures.

00:06.000 --> 00:14.000
A tool-grounded compiler maps CT, MRI, and pre-decision context
into a shared clinical-state representation.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
Each field carries its value, type, unit, observability,
uncertainty, source, and mutability. Missing stays missing.

00:22.000 --> 00:34.000
Candidate actions produce separate trajectories from one starting state.
This visualization replays illustrative rule-driven states, not learned patient forecasts.

00:34.000 --> 00:42.000
Schema, bounds, time, and provenance checks precede calibrated decoding.
Agreement with documented actions does not establish treatment benefit.

00:42.000 --> 00:48.000
Compile. Predict. Validate. Decode.
Explore ClinicalCode at qic999.github.io/projects/ClinicalCode.
